1
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:23,917
Levi and the Scouts clashed with Kenny's squad,
charging straight into their defense.

2
00:00:23,917 --> 00:00:28,042
All to reach and rescue Eren and Historia.

3
00:00:28,042 --> 00:00:29,375
However...

4
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:39,125
Fall back to the final defensive post!

5
00:00:39,125 --> 00:00:41,500
Time to regroup!

6
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,125
I'm praying, Historia.

7
00:00:44,125 --> 00:00:48,208
For God to lead and guide humanity!

8
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,000
God, my ass!

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,667
You're just giving yourself an out
and manipulating other people!

10
00:00:54,667 --> 00:00:59,125
I've had it! I won't let you kill me!

11
00:00:59,125 --> 00:01:00,917
That's the spirit!

12
00:01:00,917 --> 00:01:02,792
This is gettin' good!

13
00:01:02,792 --> 00:01:04,667
You escape from here.

14
00:01:04,667 --> 00:01:07,583
I'll destroy everything else!

15
00:01:07,583 --> 00:01:09,458
Father...

16
00:01:09,458 --> 00:01:11,208
Uri...

17
00:01:11,208 --> 00:01:12,833
Frieda...

18
00:01:12,833 --> 00:01:14,917
Wait for me...

19
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:16,542
...now...

20
00:03:04,917 --> 00:03:08,417
It's gotta be a way through
if it's all plugged up.

21
00:03:08,417 --> 00:03:09,500
Shit.

22
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:12,667
If only we had some gunpowder left...

23
00:03:12,667 --> 00:03:15,375
We cannot let them through!

24
00:03:15,375 --> 00:03:17,875
As long as we hold here, we're good!

25
00:03:23,167 --> 00:03:24,167
That's...

26
00:03:24,167 --> 00:03:25,625
A Titan transformed?

27
00:03:25,625 --> 00:03:26,875
Eren!

28
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:41,875
Here it comes! Hang on tight!

29
00:03:46,250 --> 00:03:48,833
Th-This place is gonna collapse!

30
00:03:52,625 --> 00:03:54,333
Captain!

31
00:03:54,333 --> 00:03:55,625
The hole!

32
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:03,083
Armin! Moblit! Take Hange
and get the hell out of here!

33
00:04:05,708 --> 00:04:07,375
Rod Reiss!

34
00:04:07,375 --> 00:04:09,417
You bastard!

35
00:04:09,417 --> 00:04:11,083
Forget it, Historia!

36
00:04:11,083 --> 00:04:15,750
Since that Titan's from the Reiss family,
just let him come and eat me!

37
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:17,375
Get out of here!

38
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:18,250
Hell no!

39
00:04:18,250 --> 00:04:20,333
Why won't you listen?!

40
00:04:20,333 --> 00:04:25,083
I might be humanity's enemy, but I'm your ally!

41
00:04:25,083 --> 00:04:28,500
I can't be a good girl,
and I don't wanna be God either!

42
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:29,542
But...

43
00:04:29,542 --> 00:04:33,458
When I see people crying to themselves,
saying they're not needed...

44
00:04:33,458 --> 00:04:36,958
...I wanna tell those people
that's just not true!

45
00:04:36,958 --> 00:04:40,500
No matter who! No matter where!

46
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:43,042
I'll come to their rescue!

47
00:04:47,125 --> 00:04:48,500
Historia!

48
00:04:50,167 --> 00:04:51,250
You okay?

49
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:52,583
Mikasa!

50
00:04:55,708 --> 00:04:56,833
Give me the keys!

51
00:04:56,833 --> 00:04:59,042
Captain? You guys...

52
00:05:02,750 --> 00:05:04,417
Conny, hurry!

53
00:05:04,417 --> 00:05:05,750
Forget about me!

54
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:07,667
Captain! Hurry and escape!

55
00:05:07,667 --> 00:05:10,417
Shut up already, you topless wimp!

56
00:05:10,417 --> 00:05:13,958
It's not just a Titan!
There're dudes with guns coming for us!

57
00:05:14,958 --> 00:05:16,208
He's loose!

58
00:05:17,958 --> 00:05:19,208
I think...

59
00:05:19,208 --> 00:05:22,458
That's way bigger than
the Colossal Titan, isn't it?

60
00:05:25,125 --> 00:05:28,208
The ceiling...? Look out!

61
00:05:28,208 --> 00:05:29,375
Get back!

62
00:05:36,458 --> 00:05:40,833
Hey, hey, Rod! Ya done goofed up big time!

63
00:05:40,833 --> 00:05:44,083
You thought ya knew Titans
more than the rest of us!

64
00:05:44,083 --> 00:05:47,292
Now I know you didn't, ya dumb shit!

65
00:05:47,292 --> 00:05:49,000
Captain Ackermann!

66
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,708
Idiots! Get away!

67
00:05:54,792 --> 00:05:57,458
Shit! There's no way out!

68
00:05:58,917 --> 00:06:00,625
Why?

69
00:06:00,625 --> 00:06:03,292
Wasn't he going to eat me?

70
00:06:06,083 --> 00:06:08,542
Should I transform?

71
00:06:08,542 --> 00:06:12,792
No... My Titan can't withstand all this...

72
00:06:18,792 --> 00:06:21,625
I'm sorry, everyone...

73
00:06:25,750 --> 00:06:29,125
I've been nothing but useless...

74
00:06:29,125 --> 00:06:35,292
Ever since the very beginning,
I was never the hope of humanity...

75
00:06:39,083 --> 00:06:41,292
Armor?

76
00:06:41,292 --> 00:06:44,792
What's this? Think you're some tragic hero?

77
00:06:44,792 --> 00:06:49,000
When have you ever accomplished
anything by your strength alone?

78
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,667
What a weakling.

79
00:06:50,667 --> 00:06:53,042
We've been through much worse than this.

80
00:06:53,042 --> 00:06:55,917
Not that I wanna get used to it!

81
00:06:55,917 --> 00:07:00,708
Still, it's going to suck trying
to navigate through all that.

82
00:07:00,708 --> 00:07:02,750
I'll take Eren.

83
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:06,500
We can't go nice and slow for you,
so hold on for your life.

84
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:08,000
Right.

85
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:11,042
It's useless. We can't escape.

86
00:07:11,042 --> 00:07:12,500
So do nothing?

87
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:16,708
You wanna sit here and hold hands
till we're crushed or burn to death?

88
00:07:16,708 --> 00:07:19,292
Because we're enemies of humanity?

89
00:07:20,583 --> 00:07:24,583
You know, I hate doing this
to you every time, but...

90
00:07:24,583 --> 00:07:25,792
Eren.

91
00:07:26,833 --> 00:07:29,208
You've gotta make the choice.

92
00:07:33,375 --> 00:07:35,125
I'll go with you!

93
00:07:42,792 --> 00:07:44,417
Eren!

94
00:07:44,417 --> 00:07:46,458
I'm sorry...

95
00:07:46,458 --> 00:07:50,708
Since it's the end, just this once...
I want you to let me...

96
00:07:51,875 --> 00:07:54,333
Let me believe in myself!

97
00:08:14,167 --> 00:08:16,125
What... the...?

98
00:08:16,125 --> 00:08:18,792
Everyone! Get underneath Eren!

99
00:08:23,417 --> 00:08:24,667
Caven!

100
00:08:43,292 --> 00:08:44,708
The chapel!

101
00:08:52,208 --> 00:08:53,250
Not good!

102
00:08:53,250 --> 00:08:55,042
Let's try to run!

103
00:09:04,417 --> 00:09:06,875
Section Commander! Are you okay?!

104
00:09:06,875 --> 00:09:08,333
Yeah...

105
00:09:08,333 --> 00:09:10,208
What in the world happened?

106
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,208
What the hell is that?

107
00:09:27,708 --> 00:09:29,958
If it's that big this far away...

108
00:09:29,958 --> 00:09:33,292
It's gotta be twice as big
as the Colossal Titan.

109
00:09:33,292 --> 00:09:35,750
The wall won't stand a chance...

110
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:37,708
Commander?

111
00:09:37,708 --> 00:09:39,208
Advance!

112
00:09:48,917 --> 00:09:50,167
Eren!

113
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,208
Eren!

114
00:09:55,042 --> 00:09:56,375
Eren!

115
00:10:00,208 --> 00:10:01,458
Eren!

116
00:10:09,958 --> 00:10:14,958
"Titan Hardening" "An ability used by the Armored
Titan and so forth, for a Titan to harden their body.
While in hiding, Eren Jaeger conducted experiments
to replicate this ability in order to plug Wall Maria."

117
00:10:22,792 --> 00:10:25,542
That's what I call hardening.

118
00:10:25,542 --> 00:10:30,917
Even after cutting you away,
the Titan hasn't disappeared.

119
00:10:30,917 --> 00:10:33,167
Pretty impressive, yeah?

120
00:10:37,542 --> 00:10:39,417
That bottle...

121
00:10:39,417 --> 00:10:44,583
Oh, yeah! Right before I turned into
a Titan, I drank that "Armor" bottle...

122
00:10:44,583 --> 00:10:46,167
Yeah.

123
00:10:46,167 --> 00:10:50,625
You couldn't do it at all before now,
but you used the hardening power.

124
00:10:50,625 --> 00:10:52,833
And saved all of us.

125
00:10:52,833 --> 00:10:57,958
In the blink of an eye,
you devised and built all this.

126
00:10:57,958 --> 00:11:05,000
Yeah, the construction looks shoddy, but...
I bet that's how the walls were made, too.

127
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,458
In other words...

128
00:11:07,875 --> 00:11:12,042
It's possible for us to plug
that hole in Wall Maria now.

129
00:11:13,083 --> 00:11:15,667
A lot of enemies and allies
have died on the way,

130
00:11:15,667 --> 00:11:19,250
and getting this far hasn't been pretty,

131
00:11:19,250 --> 00:11:23,833
but for as ugly as it's been,
look at the position we're in now.

132
00:11:25,208 --> 00:11:27,375
Retaking Wall Maria...

133
00:11:27,375 --> 00:11:31,667
Once we do that,
we can investigate my basement.

134
00:11:31,667 --> 00:11:34,833
But, my dad was actually...

135
00:11:41,458 --> 00:11:43,667
Captain!

136
00:11:43,667 --> 00:11:46,167
We've secured an exit!

137
00:11:46,167 --> 00:11:47,875
Armin's safe!

138
00:11:47,875 --> 00:11:50,375
Hange and Moblit, too!

139
00:11:50,375 --> 00:11:51,792
Well done.

140
00:11:51,792 --> 00:11:53,167
Eren!

141
00:11:53,167 --> 00:11:55,042
You okay?

142
00:11:55,042 --> 00:11:57,583
We're all safe, thanks to you!

143
00:11:57,583 --> 00:12:03,042
But to be perfectly honest, when you ran
off prancing while crying like a baby...

144
00:12:03,042 --> 00:12:04,667
...I thought we were doomed!

145
00:12:04,667 --> 00:12:10,625
"It's over, over! Get it together, nincompoop!
Quit bawling like a snotty-nosed brat!"

146
00:12:10,625 --> 00:12:12,167
is what I thought.

147
00:12:12,167 --> 00:12:13,333
Hey...

148
00:12:14,625 --> 00:12:15,958
Let's go.

149
00:12:15,958 --> 00:12:18,500
We're going after that big-ass Titan.

150
00:12:20,583 --> 00:12:21,792
Eren!

151
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:56,125
It's no use! Stay back! We'll get burnt!

152
00:12:56,125 --> 00:12:58,833
Commander, we can't stop it!

153
00:12:58,833 --> 00:13:01,792
It's like an Abnormal and doesn't care about us!

154
00:13:01,792 --> 00:13:03,625
Enough! Fall back!

155
00:13:03,625 --> 00:13:07,833
All that matters for now is to find
out the direction it's heading.

156
00:13:07,833 --> 00:13:11,208
Commander Erwin! It's Squad Levi!

157
00:13:11,208 --> 00:13:14,500
Eren and Historia are with them!
They succeeded!

158
00:13:20,542 --> 00:13:21,625
Erwin.

159
00:13:23,167 --> 00:13:24,792
Everyone all right?

160
00:13:24,792 --> 00:13:26,875
Hange's our only casualty.

161
00:13:28,792 --> 00:13:31,125
Seems like nothing too serious.

162
00:13:31,125 --> 00:13:33,542
Well done, everyone.

163
00:13:33,542 --> 00:13:36,917
I've got a whole slew of things
to report, but first...

164
00:13:36,917 --> 00:13:38,833
What's that Titan?

165
00:13:38,833 --> 00:13:40,542
It's Rod Reiss.

166
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:45,750
I think we'll need your call on this, Commander.

167
00:13:50,292 --> 00:13:54,042
Regardless, we don't have time
to stand here and chat.

168
00:13:54,042 --> 00:13:55,958
Return to Wall Sina.

169
00:13:55,958 --> 00:14:00,125
You're going to let that big ass
crawl right up to the wall?

170
00:14:00,125 --> 00:14:02,500
To Orvud District, actually.

171
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:05,542
That's most likely where it's headed.

172
00:14:33,208 --> 00:14:35,958
Let's put this all together...

173
00:14:35,958 --> 00:14:43,417
Basically, Rod Reiss was after the Founding
Titan, the Titan power inside Eren.

174
00:14:43,417 --> 00:14:49,292
However, unless it's in someone with Reiss
blood, you won't get its true potential.

175
00:14:49,292 --> 00:14:54,333
Though, even if a Reiss obtains
the Founding Titan's power,

176
00:14:54,333 --> 00:15:01,375
they're controlled by the First King's will and
refuse to liberate humanity from the Titans.

177
00:15:01,375 --> 00:15:05,167
Eh? Well, isn't that interesting...

178
00:15:05,167 --> 00:15:09,250
According to the First King, this is true peace?

179
00:15:09,250 --> 00:15:13,125
Now that's a weird way to look at it.

180
00:15:13,125 --> 00:15:18,000
In other words... we still have an option.

181
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:23,208
If that Titan eats me,
Rod Reiss will return to a human.

182
00:15:23,208 --> 00:15:28,042
Which means it's still possible
to have a true Founding Titan.

183
00:15:28,042 --> 00:15:29,792
You can't...

184
00:15:29,792 --> 00:15:32,750
Seems that way.

185
00:15:32,750 --> 00:15:35,875
We could capture Rod Reiss
once he becomes a human.

186
00:15:35,875 --> 00:15:38,292
Undo the First King's brainwashing.

187
00:15:38,292 --> 00:15:43,083
If we could do that, it might open
a path to save humanity.

188
00:15:44,708 --> 00:15:46,792
Plus, Eren...

189
00:15:46,792 --> 00:15:50,500
Are you saying you're fully
prepared to let that happen?

190
00:15:52,875 --> 00:15:54,167
I am.

191
00:15:57,500 --> 00:16:01,208
Eren, you can't...

192
00:16:01,208 --> 00:16:03,667
You're forgetting our other option.

193
00:16:04,708 --> 00:16:08,875
First of all, the current plan is full of flaws.

194
00:16:08,875 --> 00:16:14,417
One, there's no proof that you can
undo Rod Reiss' brainwashing.

195
00:16:14,417 --> 00:16:19,875
No matter how you restrain him,
if he alters humanity's memories, it's over.

196
00:16:19,875 --> 00:16:25,500
Basically, there's too many factors about
the Founding Titan that we just don't know.

197
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:27,250
True...

198
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:35,333
Even if Rod Reiss eats Eren, we have
no guarantee that he'll return to normal.

199
00:16:35,333 --> 00:16:37,125
Mmm.

200
00:16:37,125 --> 00:16:40,917
On the other hand, all we've ever
known is destructive pacifists.

201
00:16:40,917 --> 00:16:44,417
But as it stands, the Founding Titan
was taken from them.

202
00:16:44,417 --> 00:16:47,625
This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance for humanity.

203
00:16:48,750 --> 00:16:50,125
Yes...

204
00:16:50,125 --> 00:16:55,208
Your father was trying to save us
and humanity from the First King.

205
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:59,208
He stole the Founding Titan from my sister...

206
00:16:59,208 --> 00:17:02,333
...murdered all of the Reiss children...

207
00:17:02,333 --> 00:17:05,125
...because he had no other choice.

208
00:17:07,458 --> 00:17:11,500
If you want to save Mikasa,
Armin, and everyone else...

209
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:15,708
...you must learn to control this ability!

210
00:17:17,250 --> 00:17:19,167
Dad...

211
00:17:19,167 --> 00:17:20,500
That's right!

212
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:25,333
The Dr. Jaeger I know wouldn't do
something like that for no reason at all.

213
00:17:25,333 --> 00:17:30,708
Right. Even without having Reiss blood,
there must be a way to save humanity.

214
00:17:30,708 --> 00:17:33,833
That's why he left you the key to the basement.

215
00:17:38,125 --> 00:17:39,583
What basement?

216
00:17:39,583 --> 00:17:43,583
Oh, that whole thing?
You mean it's actually important?

217
00:17:43,583 --> 00:17:45,167
Uh, yeah...

218
00:17:45,167 --> 00:17:49,333
We've finally got a way to plug up the wall.

219
00:17:49,333 --> 00:17:52,542
The way I see it, there's only one choice.

220
00:17:52,542 --> 00:17:55,458
That makes life a little easier.

221
00:17:56,458 --> 00:17:59,667
If it means anything, I agree with that choice.

222
00:17:59,667 --> 00:18:02,708
Though, are you sure about this, Historia?

223
00:18:02,708 --> 00:18:08,625
We can't exactly have a Titan like that
wandering around inside the walls.

224
00:18:08,625 --> 00:18:11,917
One that big, we can't restrain.

225
00:18:11,917 --> 00:18:13,250
Meaning...

226
00:18:15,417 --> 00:18:18,625
We'll have to kill your father
and there's no way around it.

227
00:18:40,917 --> 00:18:42,250
Eren.

228
00:18:42,250 --> 00:18:44,000
I'm sorry.

229
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,125
Eh?

230
00:18:46,125 --> 00:18:48,250
Underneath the Reiss chapel...

231
00:18:48,250 --> 00:18:53,833
...I really considered becoming
a Titan and killing you.

232
00:18:53,833 --> 00:18:58,083
What's more, not even to save humanity...

233
00:18:58,083 --> 00:19:01,292
Only because I wanted to believe my father.

234
00:19:02,250 --> 00:19:05,958
I didn't want my father to hate me...

235
00:19:11,333 --> 00:19:14,208
But now, it's time to say goodbye.

236
00:19:32,333 --> 00:19:35,042
Please gather your squad in the hall.

237
00:19:35,042 --> 00:19:37,792
The strategy meeting is about to begin.

238
00:19:37,792 --> 00:19:39,208
All right.

239
00:19:40,583 --> 00:19:44,000
Historia. Forgot to tell you...

240
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,250
We need you to do something.

241
00:19:46,250 --> 00:19:47,583
Yes?

242
00:19:49,917 --> 00:19:52,167
Erwin's orders.

243
00:19:52,167 --> 00:19:56,833
When this battle is over, since you're
the true successor to the throne...

244
00:19:56,833 --> 00:19:58,542
...become the Queen.

245
00:19:58,542 --> 00:19:59,500
Eh?

246
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:00,375
Huh?

247
00:20:00,375 --> 00:20:03,750
Q-Queen?! Historia?!

248
00:20:03,750 --> 00:20:09,458
The coup d'état was successful, but the people
won't follow a regiment sitting at the top.

249
00:20:09,458 --> 00:20:11,833
What we need is a story to spread.

250
00:20:11,833 --> 00:20:16,917
That a true heir retook
the crown from the fake.

251
00:20:16,917 --> 00:20:18,583
I...

252
00:20:20,875 --> 00:20:22,833
Um, Captain?

253
00:20:22,833 --> 00:20:26,250
I'm sure you heard what
Historia said earlier, but...

254
00:20:26,250 --> 00:20:28,083
Well, uh...

255
00:20:28,083 --> 00:20:34,542
By leaving her father, she finally broke free
from that burden, I guess you could say...

256
00:20:34,542 --> 00:20:36,083
And yet, again...

257
00:20:36,083 --> 00:20:37,417
What?

258
00:20:37,417 --> 00:20:39,417
If you have something to say, say it.

259
00:20:39,417 --> 00:20:41,042
Uh, um...

260
00:20:41,042 --> 00:20:43,125
I-In other words...

261
00:20:43,125 --> 00:20:45,083
Conny's trying to say...

262
00:20:45,083 --> 00:20:50,875
Historia broke free from the Reiss
family and has finally found herself.

263
00:20:50,875 --> 00:20:56,250
And now you're forcing her
into another role? Isn't that...?

264
00:20:56,250 --> 00:20:58,458
Isn't that... not fair to her?

265
00:20:58,458 --> 00:20:59,417
All right.

266
00:20:59,417 --> 00:21:01,000
Eh?

267
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:04,208
My next duty is to be Queen, right?

268
00:21:04,208 --> 00:21:06,458
Understood.

269
00:21:06,458 --> 00:21:08,667
Historia...

270
00:21:08,667 --> 00:21:11,083
Thanks for your concern.

271
00:21:11,083 --> 00:21:19,250
But whether or not it's forced on me
is up to me to decide, I think.

272
00:21:19,250 --> 00:21:21,042
However...

273
00:21:21,042 --> 00:21:24,667
Captain, I do have one condition.

274
00:21:24,667 --> 00:21:26,417
Hmm?

275
00:21:26,417 --> 00:21:30,750
Since my fate is my own,
I want to lay it all on the line.

276
00:21:41,042 --> 00:21:44,250
When you're Queen,
you can punch that runt in the face.

277
00:21:46,833 --> 00:21:49,500
We've determined the location
of Rod Reiss' Titan.

278
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:51,708
It's southwest, approaching Orvud.

279
00:21:51,708 --> 00:21:55,500
At this rate, it should reach
Orvud District by dawn.

280
00:21:55,500 --> 00:21:56,958
Understood.

281
00:21:56,958 --> 00:22:01,375
Commander Erwin, we'd all
like to hear what your plan is.

282
00:22:01,375 --> 00:22:04,625
How do you intend to evacuate
the citizens in time?

283
00:22:04,625 --> 00:22:06,458
We won't evacuate.

284
00:22:06,458 --> 00:22:08,208
Wh-What?

285
00:22:08,208 --> 00:22:12,167
We'll have the citizens remain in
Orvud District just as they are.

286
00:22:12,167 --> 00:22:13,750
Uh...

287
00:22:13,750 --> 00:22:15,708
Are you insane?

288
00:23:57,625 --> 00:24:03,042
At Orvud District, Eren and the others
face off against Rod Reiss' Titan.

289
00:24:03,042 --> 00:24:08,542
Meanwhile, Historia is determined
to decide her own fate.

290
00:24:08,542 --> 00:24:12,096
Next episode: "Ruler of the Walls."
